### 8.4 Pipeline đầy đủ

```
Gốc cls_only              v2.4 cls_only
(local: models_cls_only/) (cần download từ Kaggle)
        ↓                          ↓
  logits_A [N,34,4]        logits_B [N,34,4]   ← inference trên dev + test
        ↓                          ↓
        └──────── average ──────────┘
                     ↓
         ensemble_logits [N,34,4]
                     ↓
         softmax → p_absent per aspect
                     ↓
         grid search t ∈ [0.30..0.95] trên DEV set
         → t* = [t_0*, ..., t_33*]   (34 ngưỡng riêng)
                     ↓
         apply t* lên TEST set
                     ↓
         y_pred_final [N,34]
                     ↓
         evaluate → Combined F1
```

